			"notes": "- Fixed a bug where JavaDungeons snowy biomes would appear to have harsh transitions with vanilla biomes  around ice blocks.\n- Wintershrooms now generate in the Frosted Fjord biome\n- Added missing Lone Fortress fence and wall block variations, as well as the missing gold block variant.\n- One of the cracked ice textures was improperly set as an alternate texture for regular ice, so this has been fixed.\n- Regular (non-glacial/blue) ice variants now melt properly.\n- Book blocks can now be placed in any orientation, rather than having a randomly rotated blockstate."
