			"notes": "- Creeper Woods biome now generates dirt patches randomly\n- Added Soggy Swamp grassy dirt, dense grassy dirt variants.\n- Added Cacti Canyon dark rocky dirt\n- Added cattails plant\n- Added Soggy Swamp mushroom patch block\n- Water plants and cattails now generate randomly in most biomes.\n- Soggy Swamp biome foliage color has been tweaked to more closely match the color in Dungeons.\n- Removed stray missing textures/faces from certain block models.\n- Bedroll, directional slab, and kitchen utensils now use the correct facing property and should no longer produce warnings for blockstate definitions on launch.\n- All blocks have been added to their \"mineable\" tool tags, so will now mine at the correct speed when the correct tool is used (no full survival support yet)\n- Added Dingy Jungle grassy dirt variations, and fossil pebbles block."
		},
